{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9735a250-7556-821b-90d2-b8f5f49a116d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-26T10:16:44-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Angela DeLuca",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:10:05-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:10:12-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Rosa. My name is Angela DeLuca. I have a new puppy and I need to know how to get a dog license."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:10:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. Congratulations on the puppy. How old is the dog?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:10:35-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "She's about fourteen weeks. We got her two weekends ago. She's a little beagle mix, from the shelter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:10:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Has she had her rabies shot yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:10:51-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "She's had her first round of shots. The rabies one, I'm not sure. The vet said she's too young for it yet, I think they said sixteen weeks. So that's a couple weeks off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:11:10-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's usually how it goes. The license generally requires a current rabies certificate, so you'd want to wait until she's had that shot, and then bring in the paperwork from the vet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:11:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so I can't do it until after that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:11:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, you'd want that certificate in hand first. Is she spayed, or is that scheduled?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:11:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Scheduled. The shelter did it already, actually. They gave me a paper for that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:11:52-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, bring that paper too. The fee is usually lower for a spayed or neutered dog."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:12:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And what is the fee? Do you have the number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:12:08-05:00",
      "duration": 32,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the exact amount in front of me, and I don't want to quote you wrong. When you come in or when I put together the info for you, we'll confirm it. Let me check with the person who handles the licenses and I can call you back with it. Is this a good number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:12:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, this is my landline. It's four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:12:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-four. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:12:50-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And how long is it valid once I get it? Is that a year, or is it more?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:13:01-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Dog licenses here are renewed on a set cycle, so it's not a lifetime thing. I'll make sure the validity period is on the note I give you when I call back. You'll have to renew it when it comes due."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:13:24-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. In my day we had the tag on the collar and that was the end of it. My husband was Navy, we moved around a lot, every base had its own rules. So I'm used to checking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:13:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, checking first is smart. Rules do differ everywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:13:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do I need to bring the dog with me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:13:58-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you don't need to bring her. Just the vet's rabies certificate, the spay paperwork from the shelter, and your ID. If it's easier, you can bring it all to the counter here at City Hall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:14:18-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What hours are you open? I want to go when the roads are decent. We had that snow-to-rain mess that came in Sunday and wrapped up today, so it's slick out there still."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:14:37-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's been messy. We're open regular weekday hours, so go whenever it's clear for you. There's no rush, since she can't get the shot for a couple of weeks anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:14:55-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "True. I'll wait until she's had it. By the way, I just found out the market I always go to is rearranging all its aisles. Everything's going to be in a different spot. I've been shopping there for years, so that's going to throw me off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:15:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that can be annoying when you know where everything is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:15:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is. Anyway. Do I need to fill out anything ahead of time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:15:36-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You'll fill out a short form when you come in. It's your name, address, and the dog's description, name, breed, color, that sort of thing. Can I get your address so I have it with the note?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:15:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three eighty-six Old Beach Road. That's the Easton's Beach side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:16:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three eighty-six Old Beach Road. Okay. And the dog's name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:16:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Daisy. D-A-I-S-Y."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:16:11-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Daisy, got it. So I'll check on the fee and how long the license is good for, and call you back at that number. Probably later today or tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:16:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Thank you, Rosa."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:16:32-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. DeLuca. Have a good day, and stay safe on those roads."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:16:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
